"""Hotel platform GraphQL API — designed from frontend product flows (see docs/graphql-api.md).

The API contract is split per module under graphql/<module>/*.graphqls; this
root file only declares the schema skeleton, scalars and the empty Query root
that each module extends.

API rule (enforced): GraphQL = READ. All state changes are REST
(/api/v1/**) — there is no Mutation root.
"""
schema {
	query: Query
}

scalar LocalDate
scalar DateTime

type Query
